      via the Cape. If the Red Sea reopens, Piraeus becomes the <strong>first major EU call after the Suez
      Canal</strong> and the same lane drops to roughly <strong>22–28 days</strong>. That fork is the single
      biggest number on this page, and it is why the transit table carries both routings rather than one
